Detection test with two types of overlap!

1. Two frags that overlap can't react
2. If one frag reacts with another fragment, and changes the graph by doing so, it might invalidate other graphs
    that are not in the reaction, but overlap with reacting atoms.

system.gro and expected.reactions is generated by generate.py.

Note: if in the future the order of reactions becomes less clearly defined, this test needs to be redone.